---
import { ShieldCheck, TrendingUp } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<section id="about" class="relative bg-white">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-16 px-6 md:grid-cols-2">
    <div data-aos="fade-right">
      <h2
        class="mb-6 font-serif text-3xl leading-tight text-slate-900 md:text-5xl"
      >
        Clarity for Every <br />
        <span class="text-brand-teal italic">Capital Decision</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="bg-brand-teal mb-8 h-1 w-20"></div>
      <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
        We deliver bespoke investment diligence, research, valuations, and
        accounting support - turning complex information into confident action.
        Using a mix of proven financial workflows and modern AI-enabled tools,
        we combine domain expertise with disciplined execution to produce
        accurate, decision-ready outputs.
      </p>
      <p class="mb-8 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
        Numiq’s model is built to support the evolving needs of global
        enterprises. Our team includes CFA Charterholders, Chartered
        Accountants, Financial Analysts, and Strategy Consultants who integrate
        with your organization to support you across the value chain - from
        analysis and reporting to diligence and ongoing finance operations.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-slate-100 p-2">
            <ShieldCheck class="text-brand-teal size5" />
          </div>
          <span
            class="text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-slate-700 uppercase"
            >Unyielding Integrity</span
          >
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-slate-100 p-2">
            <TrendingUp class="text-brand-teal size5" />
          </div>
          <span
            class="text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-slate-700 uppercase"
            >Continuous Innovation</span
          >
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative" data-aos="fade-left">
      <div class="border-brand-teal/20 absolute -inset-4 z-0 rounded-sm border">
      </div>
      <div
        class="group relative z-10 aspect-square w-full overflow-hidden rounded-sm bg-slate-100 shadow-2xl before:absolute before:inset-0 before:z-10 before:bg-linear-to-b before:from-transparent before:via-transparent before:to-black"
      >
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1486406146926-c627a92ad1ab?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D&auto=format&fit=crop&w=2070&q=80"
          alt="Modern financial district skyscrapers"
          class="z-0 h-full w-full object-cover opacity-90 transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"
        />

        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 z-20 w-full p-8">
          <p class="text-brand-teal font-serif text-xl italic brightness-125">
            "Scale in every action."
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
